o come through your door. Set fair prices, send them off happy, and word will start to spread. Little by little, a quiet stall becomes the talk of the town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/2e86ae7b89ba0e09b86a784e173db459.poster.avif?t=1787153781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/2e86ae7b89ba0e09b86a784e173db459.webm?t=1787153781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/2e86ae7b89ba0e09b86a784e173db459.mp4?t=1787153781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/ee2d477d2df15e9a5a038ab86daeea52.avif?t=1787153781\" width=970 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  The town lives and breathes around you. Prices climb and fall from one day to the next, and a sharp trader always finds the right moment. Buy low, sell high, and stay a step ahead of the crowd.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/69cb7d8ca414d8d9f9ae0aa61f987234.poster.avif?t=1787153781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/69cb7d8ca414d8d9f9ae0aa61f987234.webm?t=1787153781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416980/extras/69cb7d8ca414d8d9f9ae0aa61f987234.mp4?t=1787153781\" type=\"vide